ROMS: parametric robot table (CATIA V5 + VB.NET)
Copyright 2026 Krešimir Hartl

This repository contains CAD models of commercial products. They are the manufacturers' data,
included only so that the assembly opens and can be checked. All rights to these models and to the
product names remain with the manufacturers. They are not covered by this repository's own work.

Folder                      Products                                              Manufacturer
src/01_cad/03_bosch         Aluminium profile accessories: gussets, foundation     Bosch Rexroth
                            bracket, leveling foot, damping ring, T-nut,
                            T-head bolts, anchor bolt, collar nut
src/01_cad/05_robot         LR Mate 200iC industrial robot (link geometry)         FANUC
src/01_cad/07_schunk        MPG-plus 40 and EGP 64 grippers                       SCHUNK
src/01_cad/04_fasteners     Standard fasteners to DIN 125, DIN 6325, DIN 7991       standard parts

The original work in this repository is the parametric master part and its rules, the table
assembly built from the profiles, the robot kinematics and formulas, the tool assemblies, the
RomsCatiaUI application (src/02_vb) and the CATIA macros (src/03_macros).
